BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Become a Great Canvasser: CA-22 / Villegas for Congress Edition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T184500
UID:885c947ab26d93ee93e8d7c1cac0c7f0@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/signal-2026-10-01-15-14-36-442_002_20261001221521569876.png
DESCRIPTION:You don’t have to be an expert—or have the perfect speech
 —to be a great canvasser. The key is knowing how to listen\, connect\, a
 nd make the most of each conversation. In this interactive 75-minute works
 hop\, experienced canvassers will share practical strategies for engaging 
 with voters of all stripes—including strong Democrats\, those who rarely
  or never vote\, and Republicans and Independents who want to see new lead
 ership in our country. This CA-22 edition includes Villegas-specific conte
 xt\, PDI\,
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/randyvillegas/event/1049747/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
