BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:What’s in My Toolkit?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T120000
UID:96fc9b384e020c22aabc9f29baf0c306@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/organization/Mobilize%20Generalized%20Indivisible%20Event%20Campaig
 n%20Image%202_20231214173755488494.png
DESCRIPTION:This is an Virtual Ongoing event - Volunteer organized - Join 
 from anywhere - Beginner Friendly. Hosted from Santa Rosa\, CA 95402. YOU 
 are invited to Sign-up\, Register for this Ongoing Series - Witticists Vir
 tual Neighbors Forums. “What’s in My Toolkit?” In these meetings\, l
